        "original_id": "16840021-d104-51c2-845c-1f4988bc8aa0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Al Harrington\n- TV series: Hawaii Five-O, Hawaii Five-0\n- Companies: CBS\n\nFacts:\n- Al Harrington was born as Tausau Ta'a on December 12, 1935, and he is an American television actor.\n- Al Harrington is best known for playing Det. Ben Kokua on the CBS television series Hawaii Five-O.\n- Hawaii Five-0 is an American action police procedural television series that premiered on CBS on September 20, 2010.\n- Al Harrington played Mamo Kahike on the 2010 reboot Hawaii Five-0, portraying the owner of a surf shop and a bus driver in the off season.\n- CBS renewed Hawaii Five-0 for an eighth season on March 23, 2017, and that season premiered on September 29, 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
